## Performance Considerations

### Database Indexes

**risk_objects:**
- customer_id (tenant isolation filtering)
- category (category filtering)
- status (status filtering)
- business_process_map (GIN index for array operations)
- created_at DESC (time-series queries)
- likelihood_score (risk score queries)

**agent_state:**
- customer_id (tenant isolation filtering)
- agent_type (agent type filtering)
- updated_at DESC (most recent state)

**business_process_graph:**
- graph_version (version queries)
- updated_at DESC (most recent graph)

**event_log:**
- customer_id (tenant isolation filtering)
- processed (processing status)
- timestamp DESC (time-series queries)
- source (source filtering)

### Hypertable Partitioning

**risk_objects:**
- Partitioned by created_at
- Automatic partition management by TimescaleDB
- Optimized for time-series queries
- Retention policies can be configured

**event_log:**
- Partitioned by timestamp
- Automatic partition management by TimescaleDB
- Optimized for time-series queries
- High-volume event ingestion

